# Aang, Swift Savior has flash. In response to Bot2's Lightning Bolt aimed at Bot1 (turn 2), Bot1 flashes him in and
# airbends the Bolt (CR 701.65a): "Exile it. While it's exiled, its owner may cast it for {2} rather than its mana cost."
# The spell is exiled from the stack, so it does not resolve and is not countered: Bot1 is still at 20. On turn 4 Bot2
# casts it again from exile for {2} (two Mountains) and Bot1 is at 17.

